# Concrete marked small-module calculations in 15.3.67

The S₅ and L₃(2) alternatives supply order-three elements fixing the source
marker through its actual central quotient. The S₃ alternative has a
commutator plane and marked pointwise stabilizer equal to the Sylow two-subgroup,
of index three. These conditional model calculations retain the actor and module
isomorphisms. The classification of alternatives and the transport back to
N_G(Z_S) and the original line stabilizer belong to source assembly.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), printed p.1154.
